<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="2JN" style="id">Ngindo Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">2 Yohana</para>
  <para style="toc1">Balua ja pabele ja Yohana</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Yohana</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Yoh</para>
  <para style="mt2">Balua ja pabele ja Yohana</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yohana</para>
  <para style="imt">Kilongoi</para>
  <para style="ip">Balua ja pabele ja Yohana jiandikigwa na ndundame Yohana chaka cha 90 kuboka pukubelekwa Kilisto. Yohana akilengiteje mwene kutenda nga jwaandika jenie, nambu tu akikemite mwene munanhota. Minhalo ejibi mukitabu chenje gabi tela na agabi mukitabu chu Nhwalo Gwambone oguandikigwe na Yohana. Muno pakwajali nhwalo gwa amuli ja Yesu ju kupalana na panneta pamwe Yesu jwa lipalano nu kengama amuli jakwe (2 Yohana 1:5-6; Yohana 15:9-10). Bandu baamini kutenda Yohana aandike Nhwalo Gwambone tela na Yohana na balua itatu 1 Yohana na 2 Yohana na 3 Yohana kingobu patama ku Efeso.</para>
  <para style="ip">Iganukube Yohana ajiandika balua jenje kwa akalombo abapambuligwe na akinangota mundu, nambu ibonekana andi akiba akaandikila kikuta cha bandu abunhwamini Kilisto. Yohana aandika balua jenje gambu gwa kalimbia mwojo bandu abunhwamini Kilisto na kakelabuya angweto nhwalo gwa akaboli buwangi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Agabi mukitabu</para>
  <para style="io">Yohana ajilaite balua jenje kutenda baandaki beneke na bapatite abali akajakwe (Lipungu lya 1:1-3).</para>
  <para style="io">Penia ngabape mwojo bandu abunhwamini Kilisto na kakomboke angweto amuli ngolongwa (Lipungu lya 1:4-6).</para>
  <para style="io">Kabe ngaba kelebuya angweto ku nhwalo gwa akaboli buwangi (Lipungu lya 1:7-11).</para>
  <para style="io">Yohana ajomolila balua jakwe kwakapata abali kuboke kukikuta cha bandu abunhwamini Kilisto kwakiba, chakikema “nnombo gwinu jwapambuligwe na Nnoongo” (Lipungu lya 1:12-13).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Nenga nananhota nunhwandikila mwenga Amama mampambuligwe pamwe ni ingota inu mbi kupalanga mukweli. Ngiti netuje nanumpalanga, nambu boa abijimanyi kweli babi mpalanga. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Magambu kweli ejibi nkati jito, jijendekea kube na twenga machoba goa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Gwambone na kia na tengela eiboka ku Nnoongo nuku Yesu Kilisto, Mwana jwa Awawa, ipakube pamwe na twenga mukweli na mapalano.</para>
  <para style="s">Kweli na mapalano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nganhala mwojo muno kutenda ingota inu yenge itama mukweli andi ana Nnoongo Awawa pubutuamuliche. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nunhwandiki mwe mamama, twe tuboa tatunhwamine Kilisto, tupalane. Kujopa kongo ngiti amuli nhyonoje, nambu amuli ujaje ejitukiba najo kuboke pukutumbula. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Kupalana nga kongo kutama kukuagabala amuli ya Nnoongo. Amuli ejimijijoa kuboke kalakala nga jenje, mmoa mpaligwa kutama kukupalana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Akawangi ajingi pabile padunia, bandu benia kujeketeje kutenda Yesu Kilisto eike kwa mmele gukimundu. Mundu jwalenga genie nhwangi na ankana Kilisto. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kuyenie, mmegange maha mmeni mangweto kupala makaoyangaje chache chemikibegalile, kupala mpatange hupo inu tegatega.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Mundu jwajoa jwanga agabala nu kujendeke kutama mumaboulo ga Kilisto, nambu kuagabaje akwetije Nnoongo. Ojwajendeke mumaboulo genia akweti Awawa na Mwana. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kuyenie anda mundu aike kwinu mangweto nu kunneteje maboulo genia, mangweto makampokeje kachinu, wala makampataje abali. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Gambu jwampata abali mundu jwenio, abi nakwe pamwe muitendwa yakwe ibaja.</para>
  <para style="s">Malobe gukupela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ngweti ndu gukunnengelanga, nambu mbaije kunnenge genia kukunhwandakila, nambu, nhyobale kuika kwinu nu kulongela na mangweto, kupala kuala mwojo kwito kulenganile.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Ingota ya nnombo gwinu jwapambuligwe na Nnoongo yampata abali.</para>
</usx>
